<view class="container">
  <!-- 顶部提示 -->
  <view class="tips-section card">
    <view class="tips-icon">💡</view>
    <view class="tips-content">
      <view class="tips-title">情绪树洞</view>
      <view class="tips-desc text-secondary">
        在这里你可以匿名倾诉你的心声，所有发言都是匿名的，不用担心被识别。禁止说教，只允许共情和理解。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 帖子列表 -->
  <view class="posts-section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <view class="section-title">树洞帖子</view>
      <view class="post-count text-secondary">共 {{posts.length}} 条</view>
    </view>

    <view class="posts-list" wx:if="{{posts.length > 0}}">
      <view 
        class="post-item card" 
        wx:for="{{posts}}" 
        wx:key="id"
        bindtap="goToPostDetail"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
      >
        <view class="post-content">
          {{item.content}}
        </view>
        <view class="post-footer flex flex-between">
          <view class="post-time text-secondary">
            {{item.createTime}}
          </view>
          <view class="post-stats text-secondary">
            <view class="stat-item">
              <text class="stat-icon">💬</text>
              <text class="stat-text">{{item.commentCount}} 评论</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="empty-state" wx:else>
      <view class="empty-icon">🕳️</view>
      <view class="empty-text text-secondary">
        还没有帖子，快来成为第一个倾诉者吧！
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 发帖按钮 -->
  <view class="create-post-btn" bindtap="goToCreatePost">
    <text class="btn-icon">+</text>
    <text class="btn-text">发布倾诉</text>
  </view>
</view>
